  "run_commands": "Production dynamics were run by the original investigators, not by this pipeline: OpenMM 7.2.0 (doi:10.1038/s41597-023-02872-y). OpenMM is absent from MDRepo's software vocabulary, so software_name records the AMBER convention the deposited topology follows. The topology is the authors' own tleap build, republished here rather than reconstructed; the authors published no AmberTools version, and their topology files were written between 2021 and 2023.",
